{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">BUFFER-GROUP-ID function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/308971","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/BUFFER-GROUP-ID-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/BUFFER-GROUP-ID-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"BUFFER-GROUP-ID-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">BUFFER-GROUP-ID function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BUFFER-GROUP-ID-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the group ID (as an integer) of the\ntenant group to which the current record in a specified record buffer\nbelongs. If the buffer does not contain a record from a tenant group,\nthe function returns the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BUFFER-GROUP-ID-function__syntax_GC15592680406\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d184994e99\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"BUFFER-GROUP-ID-function__idGDE1Y32662363\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>BUFFER-GROUP-ID ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">buffer-name </var>)</code></pre>\n               \n                \n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">buffer-name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An identifier that specifies the name of a record buffer. </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BUFFER-GROUP-ID-function__notes_GC155A2680412\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d184994e143\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">BUFFER-GROUP-ID\ncan be used in a WHERE or TENANT-WHERE option as long as the buffer\nspecified by <var class=\"keyword varname\">buffer-name</var> is not the same as the\nbuffer of the query or FOR EACH statement.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BUFFER-GROUP-ID-function__see-also_GC155B2680418\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d184994e155\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\"><a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BUFFER-GROUP-ID-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BUFFER-GROUP-ID-attribute.html\">BUFFER-GROUP-ID attribute</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BUFFER-GROUP-NAME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BUFFER-GROUP-NAME-function.html\">BUFFER-GROUP-NAME function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BUFFER-COPY-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BUFFER-COPY-statement.html\">BUFFER-COPY statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BUFFER-GROUP-NAME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BUFFER-GROUP-NAME-function.html\">BUFFER-GROUP-NAME function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/308971","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"BUFFER-GROUP-ID function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BUFFER-GROUP-ID-function.html","type":"Manual"}